00:06:03.029 --> 00:06:04.197
an international coalition

00:06:04.197 --> 00:06:05.131
to provide Ukraine

00:06:05.131 --> 00:06:06.899
with combat air capabilities,

00:06:06.899 --> 00:06:08.968
supporting with everything from training

00:06:08.968 --> 00:06:11.003
to procuring F-16 jets.

00:06:11.604 --> 00:06:14.040
Ukrainians are talking between 50 or 40

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:15.441
and 50 F-16s,

00:06:15.441 --> 00:06:16.576
enough for about three squadrons,

00:06:16.576 --> 00:06:17.110
I think.

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:18.277
Is this more to do with Ukraine's

00:06:18.277 --> 00:06:19.979
mid to long term security needs?

00:06:19.979 --> 00:06:20.813
Because it doesn't seem

00:06:20.813 --> 00:06:22.081
they'll be in action

00:06:22.081 --> 00:06:23.116
for this counter-offensive

00:06:24.784 --> 00:06:25.051
yet?

00:06:25.051 --> 00:06:25.952
They're definitely not

00:06:25.952 --> 00:06:26.819
going to be in action

00:06:26.819 --> 00:06:28.054
for this counter offensive

00:06:28.054 --> 00:06:28.688
unless they've been

00:06:28.688 --> 00:06:29.922
preparing them in secret,

00:06:29.922 --> 00:06:32.091
which is doubtful.

00:06:32.091 --> 00:06:33.893
But I think we're looking at

00:06:33.893 --> 00:06:35.728
is like you alluded to, John,

00:06:35.728 --> 00:06:37.897
a mid to long term prospect,

00:06:37.897 --> 00:06:39.198
especially as Ukraine

00:06:39.198 --> 00:06:40.099
integrates itself

00:06:40.099 --> 00:06:41.033
even further

00:06:41.033 --> 00:06:42.602
into the Nieto defense structure.

00:06:42.602 --> 00:06:44.637
And when that happens,

00:06:44.637 --> 00:06:46.406
which I'm sure it will,

00:06:46.406 --> 00:06:48.941
they are going to be getting F-16s

00:06:48.941 --> 00:06:52.678
or similar aircraft to really in essence,

00:06:52.845 --> 00:06:53.846
put together

00:06:53.846 --> 00:06:55.715
only an Air Force,

00:06:55.715 --> 00:06:57.450
but an integrated air defense package

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:59.519
that will protect their airspace

00:06:59.519 --> 00:07:00.553
much better than they've been able

00:07:00.553 --> 00:07:02.221
to do before.

00:07:02.221 --> 00:07:03.122
We've heard from the Kremlin

00:07:03.122 --> 00:07:04.257
which has warned Britain

00:07:04.257 --> 00:07:06.092
that there will be a military response

00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:08.161
after supplying these long range

00:07:08.161 --> 00:07:09.695
missiles, cruise missiles

00:07:09.695 --> 00:07:10.329
to the Ukrainians,

00:07:10.329 --> 00:07:12.031
as well as saying this training

00:07:12.031 --> 00:07:14.133
for the Ukrainian pilots on the F-16s.

00:07:14.133 --> 00:07:15.501
What exactly does that mean, some

00:07:15.501 --> 00:07:16.636
kind of military response?

00:07:17.937 --> 00:07:19.639
It could mean several things, John.

00:07:19.639 --> 00:07:20.907
What I think they're looking at

00:07:20.907 --> 00:07:22.108
is they're trying to make it

00:07:22.108 --> 00:07:23.276
as difficult

00:07:23.276 --> 00:07:25.344
as possible for the British to provide

00:07:25.445 --> 00:07:27.547
support to the Ukrainians.

00:07:27.547 --> 00:07:29.849
The British are supporting that.

00:07:29.849 --> 00:07:30.983
And they're proceeding,

00:07:30.983 --> 00:07:32.885
you know, with the training for the tanks

00:07:32.885 --> 00:07:35.154
for the various

00:07:35.154 --> 00:07:36.656
missiles that they're providing

00:07:36.656 --> 00:07:38.591
and now for aircraft

00:07:38.591 --> 00:07:40.526
training, fighter jet training.

00:07:40.526 --> 00:07:42.929
So what the Russians will probably do is

00:07:42.929 --> 00:07:44.197
they'll probably

00:07:44.197 --> 00:07:46.132
try to up their game,

00:07:46.132 --> 00:07:47.967
perhaps in the cyber realm, perhaps

00:07:47.967 --> 00:07:50.269
in other unconventional areas,

00:07:50.269 --> 00:07:52.405
perhaps some sabotage actions.

00:07:52.405 --> 00:07:53.940
Those are the kinds of things that we can

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:54.674
perhaps see.

00:07:54.674 --> 00:07:56.175
But the British

00:07:56.175 --> 00:07:57.410
are not going to be deterred

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:58.444
by anything that the Russians

00:07:58.444 --> 00:08:00.813
are going to plan at the moment.

00:08:00.813 --> 00:08:02.315
That certainly looks that way.

00:08:02.315 --> 00:08:03.683
Colonel, so much for your time.

00:08:03.683 --> 00:08:04.217
We appreciate it.

00:08:05.218 --> 00:08:05.885
You bet, John.

